WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.460
One more studio portrait
that claims documentary truth

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.490
while creating a romantic,
context-free image.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.120
Like the first daguerreotype in this room,

4
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.050
it belongs to the Smithsonian's National Museum
of American History.

5
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.170
Repetition matters here.

6
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.290
When the same kind
of image appears again and again,

7
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.280
viewers start
to believe it shows how Indians are.

8
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.680
Line up the photographs in this room.

9
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.490
What stays the same in every one?
